      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## W7 image SR v2 (TEST) - Kandinsky ImageSR 2.0 **x2**, native nodes\n\n- Pick any image in **Image to upscale** and run. Output: `output/motion/sr/x2/kandinsky_*.png` + `bicubic_*.png` (baseline for the side by side).\n- v2: any size works (mirror pad to a multiple of 16, cropped back at the end). v1 failed on sizes like 406x483.\n- Model = native conversion for **t = 0.15** (x2 default). t must match in 3 places: model file, **Latent gain**, **ManualSigmas**. Keep bicubic x2, euler, no noise.\n- Prompt ignored (text path zeroed). No 1024 px tiling: the whole image in one pass (fine up to ~2200x3900 output).\n- License: MIT."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## W7 image SR v2 (TEST) - Kandinsky ImageSR 2.0 **x2**, native nodes\n\n- Pick any image in **Image to upscale** and run. Output: `output/motion/sr/x2/kandinsky_*.png` + `bicubic_*.png` (baseline for the side by side).\n- v2: any size works (mirror pad to a multiple of 16, cropped back at the end). v1 failed on sizes like 406x483.\n- Model = native conversion for **t = 0.15** (x2 default). t must match in 3 places: model file, **Latent gain**, **ManualSigmas**. Keep bicubic x2, euler, no noise.\n- Prompt ignored (text path zeroed). No 1024 px tiling: the whole image in one pass (fine up to ~2200x3900 output).\n- License: MIT."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
